# Every text file is LF, in the index and in the working tree. Windows checkouts
# default to CRLF (the runner's core.autocrlf), and a shebang plus CRLF makes
# vite's SSR transform emit a literal `#!` mid-module: tools/bundle-cli.test.mjs
# died at load with a SyntaxError and contributed no tests at all.
#
# Repo-wide rather than per-file: every text file here is already stored as LF,
# so this normalizes nothing, and the next script that gets a test inherits the
# rule instead of rediscovering it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Icons are the only binaries: keep them out of normalization and out of text diffs.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
